{"id":"wb-6-642","name":"千佛阁","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"千佛阁","text":"千佛阁是位于中国河南省焦作市武陟县县城南大街北端的一处明清寺庙建筑群，原有佛教殿阁和道教庙宇，现存主要建筑为山门、中佛殿和千佛阁。主体楼阁为三重檐歇山顶建筑，屋面覆绿色琉璃瓦。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E9%98%81","revisionId":95427393,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95427393","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/21cb322ec6ae9e8fdd4f09c5.jpg","title":"20230214_Qianfoge_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20230214_Qianfoge_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/20230214_Qianfoge_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Qianfoge in Wuzhi County","width":320,"height":213}}